iens bildande gick kyrkorna i bl.a. Serbien, Montenegro och Bosnien-Hercegovina samman och har sedan 1920 letts av en patriark med säte i Belgrad. Kyrkan var fram till Jugoslaviens sönderfall indelad i ett tjugotal stift med ytterligare biskopssäten för emigrantförsamlingar i USA och Västeuropa.  a{"@id":"0dwklm8wxmxs57sh","modified":"2021-12-20T12:24:36.918+01:00","checksum":"-7144526553"}2librisxl01038cz  a  00289n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000110006504300120007611000360008841000260012441000250015041000280017541000550020341000310025841000170028941000360030641000170034241000190035941000590037866700360043767000650047367000350053867800120057371000550058588701080064027022020211220120229.0060317n| az|nnaabn          |n ana    |d  aSbswe  ae-ru---2 aRusskaja pravoslavnaja cerkovʹ2 aRyska ortodoxa kyrkan2 aRysk-ortodoxa kyrkan2 aRussian Orthodox Church2 aRusskai︠a︡ pravoslavnai︠a︡ t︠s︡erkovʹ2 aRussische Orthodoxe Kirche2 aChiesa russa2 aRussian Orthodox Eastern Church2 aEglise russe2 aRussian Church2 aРусская православная церковь  aUppdaterad: 2021-12-20 S/fatkla  aWork cat.: Talʹberg, Nikolaj. Istorija Russkoj Cerkvi, 2004  aVIAFbVariant i originalskrift  aLC Auth20aRusskai︠a︡ pravoslavnai︠a︡ t︠s︡erkovʹ  a{"@id":"sq47bbkb1gxxkgb","modified":"2021-12-20T12:02:29.931+01:00","checksum":"41397354026"}2librisxl00444cz  a  00157n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000190006504200090008415500140009345500100010745500120011745500230012955500260015288701080017835344520211220105420.0120606n| az|nnbabn          |n ana    ||  aNBbswefsaogf  9Fack  aFördrag  aAvtal  aTraktat  aÖverenskommelser  wgaJuridiskt material  a{"@id":"zw9dlk6h4f1dtx6","modified":"2021-12-20T10:54:20.218+01:00","checksum":"78488620988"}2librisxl00723cz  a  00217n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002403500150006504000170008004200090009706500170010615000210012345000210014445000200016555000140018567000