of Commagene,dfl. 69-30 B.C.0 aAntiokos  aSaknas i sv. encc.& AK. NameAuth har 900/2. EncBrit & EncAmer un- der Commagene: A I. OxfClassDict har bl.a. citatet nedan. AnnéePhil '88: A-chos (roi de C). S: A-chus I av K. Hyamson: A-us I: Kg. of C.  aA "blomstrade" (lat., eng."fl.") 69-30 f.Kr., var son & arvtagare till kung Mithridates I Callinicus av Kommagene i norra Syrien. "A built a royal mausoleum for his father at Arsameia and a monumental tomb for himself on Mt. Taurusaat Nimrud Dagh there stood a statue of the deified king on a terrace among seated gods of colossal size" . Basens fall handlar just om kungakulten & kultreformerna i K. A gav sig för Lucullus 69, hjälpte Pompejus i inbördeskriget.- 910219/REG  a{"@id":"86lnn80s2kcx69j","modified":"2012-09-17T09:45:01+02:00","checksum":"68681465866"}2librisxl00416nz  a  00121n  45000010017000000050017000170080041000340400016000750430012000911000030001036780052001338870109001854djqrjg52d1gqnm520181107174958.0181107nb az|nnaabn          |n aaa    ||  aZbsweerda  ae-sw---1 aMinelli, Guglielmo,d1988  aForskare vid Chalmers Tekniska Högskola, 2018  a{"@id":"4djqrjg52d1gqnm5","modified":"2018-11-07T17:49:58.915+01:00","checksum":"27427541384"}2librisxl00570nz  a  00169n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000160006504300120008104600130009310000350010666700270014167000370016867000690020567800220027488701040029640940120180219110118.0180219nb az|nnaabn          |n aaa    ||  aSbsweerda  ae-sw---  f198212171 aBärgaskörd, Gustav,d1982-  a2018-02-19/S/NB/maryng  aBirthday :b(Född: 1982-12-17)  aMedveten motorisk träning, 2016:bt.p. (Gustav Bärgaskörd)  aFörskollärare  a{"@id":"53hlvtkp0kw1q4w","modified":"2018-02-19T11:01:18+01:00","checksum":"36751719645"}2librisxl01699cz  a  00265n  45000010007000000050017000070080041000240400015000650430012000801000037000924000046001296700128001756700103003036700113004066700074005196700074005936700074006676700