 och physico-oeconomisk beskrifning öfwer Pedersöre sokn i Österbotn. Andra eller historiska delen. Med wederbörandes tilstånd i kongl. lärosätet wid aura elf, til allmän granskning utgifwen af Hans Henric Aspegren ... och i stora läro-salen därstädes förswarad af Gabriel G. Aspegren, österbotninge. Den 19 martii 1766. på wanlig tid förmidd., 1766 :bt.p. (Gabriel G. Aspegren)  aKotivuori, Yrjö. Ylioppilasmatrikkeli 1640-1852b(Aspegren, Gabriel)  aPräst; fil. mag. (1769 i Åbo), pastorsadjunkt (från 1770) och utnämnd kyrkoherde (1784, dog före tillträdet) i Jakobstad. Son till Gabriel Andreae Aspegren (1708-1784)  a{"@id":"tr58h45c0s1hvzm","modified":"2016-12-12T16:06:01+01:00","checksum":"58267066255"}2librisxl00500nz  a  00133n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000160006504300120008110000290009367000580012267800820018088701040026241151520180521091641.0180521nb az|nnaabn          |n aaa    |d  aHbsweerda  ae-sw---1 aMarkowski, Peter,d1981-  aCollaboration routines, 2018:bt.p. (Peter Markowski)  aVerksam vid Företagsekonomiska institutionen, Stockholms universitet (2018)  a{"@id":"mkz2bdd55tqf1qm","modified":"2018-05-21T09:16:41+02:00","checksum":"63609713300"}2librisxl01192cz  a  00205n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000150006504300210008010000300010140000400013140000310017140000490020240000390025167000710029067000650036167001240042667803320055088701040088239566720170329153101.0160603nb ac|nnaabn          |n aaa    |d  aRabsweec  ae-fi---ae-sw---1 aCarling, Olof,d1752-18201 aCarling, Olof Andersson,d1752-18201 aCarling, Olaus,d1752-18201 aCarling, Olaus,cOstrobotniensis,d1752-18201 aCarling, Olaus Andreae,d1752-1820  aKotivuori, Yrjö. Ylioppilasmatrikkeli 1640-1852b(Carling, Olof)  aUppsala universitets matrikel. Bd 3, s. 169b(Carling, Olof)  aHärnösands domkyrkoförsamlings kyrkoarkiv, Husförhörslängder, AIa:4b (1812-1821), uppsl. 6b(Carling, Olof) 