ning, effektiv marknadskommunikation ...".  Från den 16/10 1967 därför namnet Sveriges marknadsförbund. - Enligt NE från 1935  a{"@id":"nl0202k62tr55f4","modified":"2012-09-26T12:01:48+02:00","checksum":"54383516584"}2librisxl00568nz  a  00169n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000160006504300120008111000110009341000230010441000200012766700280014767000380017567800810021388701040029437550220140618110419.0140618n| ac|nnaabn          |n ana    ||  aNLTbsweec  ae-sw---2 aSpecma2 aSpecialmaskiner AB2 aSpecialmaskiner  a2014-06-18/S/NLT/annhak  aSpecma, 1970-1979:bt.p. (Specma)  aGrundades 1918 som ett rent handelsföretag under namnet Specialmaskiner AB  a{"@id":"64jmtmxq29ljlvv","modified":"2014-06-18T11:04:19+02:00","checksum":"45409484223"}2librisxl00520cz  a  00157n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000140006504300120007911000310009141000330012266700270015567000610018267800150024388701040025837199920170912154303.0140312n| ac|nnaabn          |n ana    ||  aSbsweec  ae-sw---2 aS:ta Clara kyrkas vänner2 aSankta Clara kyrkas vänner  a2014-03-06 S/NB/evaabr  aEffektiv bön, 2011:bt.p. (S:ta Clara kyrkas vänner)  aFörening  a{"@id":"fcrv2q8z3rq6gcb","modified":"2017-09-12T15:43:03+02:00","checksum":"42076114988"}2librisxl00590cz  a  00145n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000160006504300120008111000380009341000440013167000950017567800700027088701040034026308020121029090713.0051018n| ac|nnaabn          |n ana    |d  aNLTbsweec  ae-sw---2 aSignaltruppernas kamratförening2 aFälttelegrafisternas kamratförening  aFälttelegrafisten. Fälttelegrafisten, 1934-:bt.p. (Signaltruppernas kamratförening)  aFram till 1943 med namnet Fälttelegrafisternas kamratförening  a{"@id":"sq4692mb3gnd2zv","modified":"2012-10-29T09:07:13+01:00","checksum":"74093190308"}2librisxl00619cz  a  00157n  45000010007000000050017000070080041000240400016000650430012000811100031000934100