g  aUtvecklingsledare  a{"@id":"gdsw4qz035m6txn","modified":"2016-11-21T10:43:45+01:00","checksum":"63360969822"}2librisxl02513cz  a  00229n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002402400270006504000140009204300120010610000390011840000390015740000390019640000390023540000360027467002150031067009660052567003470149167000070183867803340184588701040217924509720121023113157.0041026n| ac|nnaabn          |n aaa    |d7 a00000000505140432isni  aLbsweec  ae-sw---1 aBiörner, Eric Julius,d1696-17501 aBiörner, Erik Julius,d1696-17501 aBjörner, Eric Julius,d1696-17501 aBjörner, Erik Julius,d1696-17501 aBjörner, Erik Jul.d1696-1750  aBiörner, Eric Julius. Erici Julii Biörneri Epistola responsoria, ad virum clariss. dom. Olavum Celsium, ... de ejusdem dubiis circa delineationem & explicationem runarum, 1726:bt.p. (Erici Julii Biörner)  aNordiska kämpa dater, i en sagoflock samlade om forna kongar och hjältar. För hwilken, förutan et ständigt ättartahl på alla befintliga swenska kongar och drottningar, äfwen et företal finnes, angående orsaken til detta wärk, göta språkets förmån, gamla sakers nögje, sagors trowärdighet och de här trycktas tidatahl, jämte förtekning på dem, som tilförende warit tryckte &c. Volumen historicum, continens variorum in orbe hyperboreo antiquo regum, heroum et pugilum res præclare : & mirabiliter gestas. Accessit, præter conspectum genealogicum svethicorum regum & reginarum accuratissimum, etiam præfatio de caussis editi hujus operis, linguæ gothicæ prærogativa, rerum antiquarum jucunditate, historiarum hyperb. : fide, earumque heic editarum chronotaxi; addito etiam ante evulgatarum catalogo &c. Stockholmiæ, typis Joh. L. Horrn, reg. archivi typogr. anno 1737, 1737:bintroduction (Erik Julius Björner)  aBiörner, Eric Julius. Nordisk hjälta prydnad, af gullringar, dem mann fordom burit, så wäl på armar och händer, som fingrar; jämte bifogade figurer, i mögjeligaste kårthet, beskrefwen af Erik Jul. Biörner ... Tryckt i Stockholm af Joh. Laur. Horrn, kongl. antiq. arch. boktryckaren. 1739, 1739:bt.p. (Erik Jul. Biörner)  aNE  aFornforskare och skriftställare, tjänsteman i Antikvitetsarkivet. Som rudbeckian förlöjligades B. av bl.a. Dalin, som företrädde en modernare antikvarisk forskning. B:s utgåva av fornnordiska sagor, Nordiska kämpadater (1737), fick betydelse för romantikens göticism, speciellt för Tegnér och Geijer. / NE  a{"@id":"c9prvz6w1sq9xjg","modified":"2012-10-23T11:31:57+02:00","checksum":"73695464180"}2librisxl00609nz  a  00181n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000160006504300120008104600130009310000280010637400310013466700270016567000340019267000480022667800490027488701040032340651520171108141900.0171108nb az|nnaabn          |n aaa    ||  aSbsweerda  ae-sw---  f195411041 aDrevenhorn, Eva,d1954-  aDistriktssköterskor2sao  a2017-11-08 S/NB/astnym  aBirthdayb(Född 1954-11-04)  aHemsjukvård, 2017:bt.p. (Eva Drevenhorn)  aFil.dr., lektor vid Lunds universitet (2017)  a{"@id":"zw9dnj5h251p6jb","modified":"2017-11-08T14:19:00+01:00","checksum":"38708443089"}2librisxl00497nz  a  00145n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000140006504300120007910000310009166700270012267000550014967800430020488701040024739947320161213125838.0161213nb ac|nnaabn          |n aaa    ||  aSbsweec  ae-sw---1 aHyllerud, Emmanuel,d1982-  a2016-12-13/S/NB/oloost  aGud och mitt jobb, 2016:bt.p. (Emmanuel Hyllerud)  aEntreprenör. Ämne: försäljning  a{"@id":"75knwjlr3vgjt0f","modified":"2016-12-13T12:58:38+01:00","checksum":"61720898941"}2librisxl00655nz  a  00193n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002404000160006504300120008104600150009310000360010840000450014440000360018966700260022567000720025167000140032367800200033788701040035740424120170821134034.0170821nb az|nnaabn          |n aaa    ||  aSbsweerda  ae-sw---  f1812g18881 aBerger, Wilhelm